{"type":"text","timestamp":1788703004953,"sessionID":"ses_f88fe7164ffeInF4zBdlutTin0","part":{"id":"prt_07701d653001JDI7ye2bVyum9k","messageID":"msg_077018f600025LPREcYte0ZO6O","sessionID":"ses_f88fe7164ffeInF4zBdlutTin0","type":"text","text":"I'll analyze the three reference works and the format requirements to construct a comprehensive plan for the planning document. Let me first review the format structure carefully.","time":{"start":1788703004243,"end":1788703004941}}}
